---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Takedown Requests
description: Request content removal or report infringement
---

<h1>Takedown Requests</h1>

<p>
  {{ site.brand or site.name }} links to third-party sources and may display limited metadata (title
  and short summary). If you believe any content on this site should be removed, please contact us
  with the information below.
</p>

<h2>What to include</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The URL(s) on our site you want removed</li>
  <li>The original source URL(s)</li>
  <li>Your name and role (e.g. rights holder, authorized agent)</li>
  <li>A brief explanation of the issue</li>
  <li>Any supporting documentation (if applicable)</li>
</ul>

{% if site.contactEmail %}
  <p>
    <strong>Email:</strong>
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>
  </p>
{% else %}
  <p class="muted">
    Contact email is not configured yet. See <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Contact</a>.
  </p>
{% endif %}

